### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "username": "jperez",
  "email": "jperez@pos.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "rolId": 1
}

### Actualizar usuario
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Gomez",
  "email": "jgomez@pos.com"
}

### Inactivar usuario
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios/2/inactivar
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "motivo": "Solicitud del administrador"
}
